    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13482" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποπομπ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποπέμπω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sending away,</i>
